                "date": "2024-03-08",
                "text": "Any effects (such as proliferate) that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with rad counters."
            },
            {
                "date": "2024-03-08",
                "text": "The cards are milled all at once, which means abilities that trigger “whenever one or more nonland cards are milled” will trigger exactly once as long as at least one nonland card was milled."
            },
            {
                "date": "2024-03-08",
                "text": "If a player has fewer cards remaining in their library than the number of rad counters they have when the triggered ability resolves, they’ll mill as many cards as they can."
            }
        ]
    }
}

